,{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":221,"_203":222},[],"High ceilings and expansive glazing","4dc16c01bf0d",[226],[],{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":227,"_203":228},[],"Premium natural stone finishes","8e37c2302111",[232],[],{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":233,"_203":234},[],"Custom-designed joinery throughout","46f2efb85ac5",[238],[],{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":239,"_203":240},[],"Designer kitchen with premium appliances","df89c3404ecf",[244],[],{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":245,"_203":246},[],"Open-plan kitchen, living and dining","4a3267b6798d",[250],[],{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":251,"_203":252},[],"Premium architectural façade","7f860b5a529a",[256],[],{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":257,"_203":258},[],"Architecturally designed contemporary home","5ac407ef52f1",[262],[],{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":263,"_203":264},[],"Built on a 300sqm inner-city allotment","7a4121cab82c",[268],[],{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":269,"_203":270},[],"Approximately 335sqm (36 Squares) custom residence","1ca9cd236cca",[275],[],"h3",{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":276,"_203":277},[],"Key Features","8ba20743643c",[281],[],{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":282,"_203":283},[],"Every aspect of the home has been carefully considered to deliver a residence that is both functional and visually striking, demonstrating our commitment to quality and innovation.","9461264a2d82",[287],[],{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":288,"_203":289},[],"Siari Build managed the project from planning through to construction, coordinating every stage to ensure a seamless building process. By combining intelligent design, efficient site management and exceptional craftsmanship, the project maximises every square metre of the allotment while creating spacious, light-filled living areas and a premium architectural finish.","069ec55841ed",[293],[],{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":294,"_203":295},[],"Our Solution","fee527c28b83",[299],[],{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":300,"_203":301},[],"Managing planning approvals, demolition, engineering, protection works and construction sequencing while maintaining safety, quality and efficiency required strong project management and close coordination with consultants, authorities and trades.","81d15e42d8b7",[305],[],{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":306,"_203":307},[],"Constructing a luxury custom home within Melbourne’s inner-city environment presented a unique set of challenges. The compact 300sqm site, close proximity to neighbouring properties, restricted access and extensive council requirements demanded meticulous planning before construction could commence.","9ae5de5ebb23",[311],[],{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":312,"_203":313},[],"The Challenge","9312f000e9b5",[317],[],{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":318,"_203":319},[],"Located in one of Melbourne’s most established suburbs, this project reflects Siari Build’s ability to deliver high-quality custom homes on challenging urban sites where careful planning, precision and attention to detail are essential.","48b27a3a1a57",[323],[],{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":324,"_203":325},[],"The Collingwood Residence is a bespoke 36-square architecturally designed custom home currently under construction on a 300sqm inner-city allotment. Designed to maximise space, natural light and modern family living, the residence combines contemporary architecture with premium finishes and exceptional craftsmanship.","ce610f70c49f",[330],[],"h2",{"_184":199,"_186":200,"_201":331,"_203":332},[],"Overview",{"_334":335,"_336":337,"_338":339},"settings",{"_397":398,"_399":400,"_401":402,"_403":404,"_405":111,"_406":407,"_408":-5,"_409":410,"_411":361,"_412":-5,"_413":-5,"_414":361,"_415":416,"_417":418,"_419":420,"_421":422,"_423":-5,"_424":425,"_426":427,"_138":428,"_429":430,"_431":432},"navigation",{"_358":359,"_360":361,"_362":363,"_364":365},"services",[340,341,342,343,344,345],{"_203":356,"_30":357},{"_203":354,"_30":355},{"_203":352,"_30":353},{"_203":350,"_30":351},{"_203":348,"_30":349},{"_203":346,"_30":347},"Extra space for family, guests or rental income - designed and built properly, not bolted on.","Granny Flats","From a single kitchen to a whole-home transformation - old bones, new life.","Renovations","More room without the move. Ground-floor and second-storey extensions that look like they were always there.","Extensions & Additions","Dual occupancies and townhouses that get the most out of your site — and your return.","Multi-Dwelling Developments","Already have plans or an architect? We build to your design with the rigour it deserves.","Bespoke Builds","Architecturally led homes built around how you actually live — not a catalogue floor plan.","Custom Homes","footerMenu",[386,387,388,389,390,391],"headerCtaEnabled",true,"headerMenu",[371,372,373,374],"socialMenu",[366],{"_367":-5,"_368":369,"_149":370},"icon","label","Instagram","https://www.instagram.com/siari_build/",{"_368":-5,"_376":384,"_378":385},{"_368":-5,"_376":382,"_378":383},{"_368":-5,"_376":380,"_378":381},{"_368":375,"_376":377,"_378":379},"Start Your Project","pageSlug","contact","pageTitle","Contact","projects","Projects","about","About","home","Home",{"_368":-5,"_376":384,"_378":385},{"_368":-5,"_376":382,"_378":383},{"_368":-5,"_376":380,"_378":381},{"_368":-5,"_376":377,"_378":379},{"_368":394,"_376":395,"_378":396},{"_368":-5,"_376":392,"_378":393},"privacy-policy","Privacy Policy","FAQ","faq","Frequently Asked Questions","address","Point Cook, Victoria","copyrightText","All rights reserved.","email","info@siaribuild.com.au","legalLine","ABN 20 688 039 894 | Builder License CDB-U 101713","maintenanceEnabled","maintenanceHeading","WE'RE ON THE TOOLS.","maintenanceImage","maintenanceMessage","The site's getting a quick upgrade and will be back shortly. In the meantime, if you'd like to start a project, reach us using the options below.","maintenanceShowContact","mapAddressLabel","mapAreaRadius","mapHidePin","mapLocation",{"_186":433,"_143":434,"_435":436,"_437":438},"mapZoom",12,"notFoundButtonLabel","Back to Home","notFoundHeading","THIS ONE'S OFF THE PLANS.","notFoundImage","notFoundMessage","The page you're after isn't here — moved, renamed, or never built. Let's get you back to solid ground.","phone","0419 000 991","Siari Build","tagline","Designed to Impress. Built to Last.","workingHours","Monday - Friday: 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM\nSaturday: 9:00 AM - 2:00 PM\nSunday: Closed","geopoint",7,"lat",-37.895696,"lng",144.76186]
